@startuml
title 시퀀스: 플레이어 퍼즐 완료 -> 결과 생성 -> 스킬/공격 실행

participant Player as "Player(Input/UI)"
participant PuzzleSystem as "PuzzleSystem"
participant BattleStage as "BattleStage"
participant ResultQueue as "ResultQueue"
participant SkillResolver as "SkillResolver"
participant TargetUnit as "TargetUnit(s)"

Player -> PuzzleSystem: 퍼즐 풀이 시작
activate PuzzleSystem
PuzzleSystem -> Player: 퍼즐 시간/인터랙션 제공
note right: 플레이어가 퍼즐을 완성
Player -> PuzzleSystem: 퍼즐 완료(패스)
PuzzleSystem -> BattleStage: OnPuzzleCompleted(resultData)
deactivate PuzzleSystem

activate BattleStage
BattleStage -> ResultQueue: Enqueue(resultData)
deactivate BattleStage

ResultQueue -> SkillResolver: Dequeue & Resolve(skillList, targets)
activate SkillResolver
SkillResolver -> TargetUnit: ApplySkill/ApplyDamage
TargetUnit --> SkillResolver: 상태 변경/피격 결과
deactivate SkillResolver

ResultQueue -> BattleStage: Notify 처리 완료

note over TargetUnit: 사망이면 Death 처리(FadeOut, Release, Factory 반환)

@enduml
